  "details": "As I tested with few people and myself,\nIt seems to be there is client issue on rendering on quest1.\nThere is no issue at all with Quest2 but Quest1 got issue like Z-Fighting kind of effect on edge of all models.\nI can confirm there is no such a thing cause z-fighting in my world and I can confirm there is no issue at all on Quest2. As I use this model on other world too which has no issue with Quest1.\nIt only happens after recent update.\nWorld ID: wrld_7571b0a0-6fe1-4c93-8899-005a00ee6ab6 (Three Lions Pub)",
